{"id":50418,"mal_id":50418,"title":"Ninjala (TV)","englishTitle":null,"title_english":null,"alternative_titles":{"synonyms":[],"en":"","ja":"ニンジャラ"},"synopsis":"The year is 20XX. The ninja, who once forged the history of Japan, were scattered across the country during the Meiji Restoration. As these ninja mingled with the other clans, their bloodline thinned, and they gradually faded from sight. The descendants of these ninja clans, seeking to preserve their heritage, formed the WNA (World Ninja Association) in the hope of carrying on their legacy.\n\nAnd so it was that the WNA succeeded in developing Ninja-Gum, an art which could summon forth the strength of the Shinobi. And yet creating the most powerful Ninja-Gum requires the strongest of ninja DNA. So it was that the Ninjala Tournament was held, that the mightiest of all ninjas could be found... \n\n(Source: Official Game website)","synopsis_es":"El año es 20XX. Los ninja, que una vez forjaron la historia de Japón, se dispersaron por todo el país durante la Restauración Meiji. A medida que estos ninjas se mezclaron con los otros clanes, su línea de sangre se diluyó y gradualmente desaparecieron de la vista. Los descendientes de estos clanes ninja, buscando preservar su herencia, formaron la WNA (Asociación Mundial Ninja) con la esperanza de continuar con su legado.\n\nY así fue como la WNA logró desarrollar Ninja-Gum, un arte que podía convocar la fuerza de los Shinobi. Y, sin embargo, crear el Ninja-Gum más poderoso requiere el ADN ninja más fuerte. Así fue que se celebró el Torneo Ninjala, donde se pudo encontrar al más poderoso de todos los ninjas... \n\n(Fuente: sitio web oficial del juego)","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"currently_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1395,"average_episode_duration":1395,"startDate":"2022-01-08","start_date":"2022-01-08","endDate":null,"end_date":null,"season":"winter","year":2022,"start_season":{"year":2022,"season":"winter"},"episodes":null,"num_episodes":null,